:"<b>🧾 支出记录</b>","<b>🧿 Curses, more carefully</b>":"<b>🧿 谨慎选择诅咒</b>","<b>🩸 Enemy abilities in the simulator</b>":"<b>🩸 模拟器中的敌方技能</b>","<b>🪜 Tougher team test in dungeons</b>":"<b>🪜 地牢中的严格队伍测试</b>","<b>🪼 Elyssia (Abyssal) can be picked</b>":"<b>🪼 可选择 Elyssia (Abyssal)</b>","<b>🪽 Flying enemies are back in the simulator</b>":"<b>🪽 模拟器恢复飞行敌人识别</b>","<b>🪽 The new flyer rules</b>":"<b>🪽 新的飞行敌人规则</b>","A Daily that lost 2 in a row rested for 6 hours, and one that rested before you switched Keep Playing Daily on stayed rested with it on. Now the switch plays through any rest from losses, old ones included. A rest because the game refused the pad still holds, so a refusal can't turn into a loop.":"每日挑战连败 2 场后会休息 6 小时；过去先休息再打开“持续每日挑战”仍不会继续。现在此开关会跳过所有因连败产生的休息，包括旧记录。因游戏拒绝挑战入口产生的休息仍保留，避免反复尝试的死循环。","A buffer now gets only the copies that keep its buff up all the time. For Windsong that's 2 for each group of attackers, taking turns, so a force at the back gets its own pair. The rest of the yen goes to your attackers.":"增益辅助只放置维持全程增益所需的数量。Windsong 每组攻击单位配置 2 个轮流释放，因此后方部队也会拥有自己的一对。剩余日元用于攻击单位。","A buffer that stacks is now worth the step its copies make together: Windsong +30% with 2 copies, +69% with 4, +100% with 6. The farm used to stop at 3 and hold +30%. Now it puts the block down early, next to your main damage dealers.":"可叠加辅助按多副本共同带来的提升估值：2 个 Windsong 为 +30%，4 个为 +69%，6 个为 +100%。过去只放 3 个并保持 +30%；现在会尽早在主力输出旁放齐辅助组。","A community tier list (Oct 2026) now rates units the game hides: an S or SS evolution counts as joining your team, and the Units → Goals lists every banner unit and your own units with their ratings.":"采用 2026 年 10 月的社区评级，为游戏隐藏的单位评分。S 或 SS 级进化会按能够加入队伍计算；“单位 → 目标”列出所有卡池单位及已持有单位的评级。","A curse lasts to room 20, and a death loses every chest in the run. Past room 10, or with chests riding on the run, a curse is taken only if the simulator says your team still beats the rooms after it; past room 15, or with many chests, it has to beat them against 30% tougher enemies. A curse the simulator can't play (Chaos, Eruption, Armor, Burst) is passed when chests are riding. Shrines follow the same rule.":"诅咒持续到第 20 房，死亡会丢失本轮全部宝箱。超过第 10 房或已携带宝箱时，仅在模拟器判断附带诅咒后仍能通关才接受；超过第 15 房或携带大量宝箱时，还必须能击败强度提高 30% 的敌人。携带宝箱时会跳过尚未支持模拟的混沌、喷发、装甲和爆发诅咒。神龛同样遵守此规则。","A dungeon room that wants a different team now gets it as the room loads, before the first wave, instead of a trip to the lobby. No wave starts until all six are right, and if the swap fails the run goes to the lobby, which doesn't cost a try.":"地牢房间需要换队时，现在会在房间加载、第一波开始前直接更换，而不是返回大厅。六个槽位未全部正确前不会开波；换队失败则返回大厅，不消耗尝试次数。","A dungeon team swap now has to go further up the same rising test as every other mode, up to 24× enemy strength. A tie keeps your team.":"地牢换队现与其他模式一样接受逐步增强的敌人测试，最高达 24 倍强度；结果相同时保留当前队伍。","A limit break raises a unit's level cap (100 → 110). It takes a Divine Wish and fodder units, which are destroyed.":"突破会提高单位等级上限（100 → 110），需要消耗神圣愿望和素材单位；素材单位会被销毁。","A match record or study report could be sent twice when a study run went to the lobby right after its match. Now the farm saves at once that it went.":"研究局结束后立即返回大厅，曾可能重复发送战斗记录或研究报告；现在会立即记录已发送状态。","A new pick on the Farm → Stages. Smart plays a portal you hold when its map drops something your evolutions need, from any of the game's 38 kinds. Pick a kind to play it first whenever you hold one, or switch Portals off to keep them.":"“刷取 → 关卡”新增传送门选择。智能模式会从游戏的 38 种传送门中，挑选你持有且掉落进化材料的地图；指定类型后，持有时会优先挑战，也可关闭传送门以保留它们。","A portal that didn't open set every portal aside for half an hour, and a long Shibuya Infinite run took the turn with 16 portals waiting. Now portals never rest: one that doesn't open or start is set aside on its own, and the next try uses another portal you hold. Losing streaks don't rest them either.":"过去一个传送门开启失败会让所有传送门搁置半小时，甚至持有 16 个传送门仍去打漫长的涩谷无限模式。现在传送门不再整体休息：开启或启动失败只暂缓该传送门，下次改用其他持有传送门；连败也不会触发休息。","A portal tier can open on fewer lanes than its map has, and the game picks which each match. Units used to be placed for every lane, so some stood where no enemy came. Now the farm waits for the first enemies, places on their lane only, and its first unit goes down sooner.":"传送门层级可能只开放地图的部分路线，每局由游戏选择。过去所有路线均放单位，导致部分单位无敌可打。现在等待首批敌人出现，只在其路线放置，而且首个单位更早部署。","A portal you hold used to go first whatever its chances. Now only one the simulator gives 25% or more, or one your team has already won, goes ahead of other modes.":"过去持有传送门会无视胜率优先挑战。现在只有模拟胜率至少 25%，或当前队伍曾获胜的传送门，才会排在其他模式之前。","A portal's weakness (Air Weakness x1.5) counted as no bonus at all, and air is only ever a unit's second type. Now the bonus counts for every unit that deals that type, so the team search can bring them.":"过去传送门的“空中弱点 ×1.5”未计入加成，而空中属性只会是单位的第二类型。现在所有能造成该类型伤害的单位都会正确获得加成，队伍搜索也会考虑它们。","A search ran some teams twice at the same strength (12 of 118 runs on Shibuya Infinite) and worked out each unit's damage again every simulated second. Now it remembers both. The search before a match's first wave or in an opened portal takes about 12 s instead of 18, trying as many teams as before and picking the same one. Searches in the lobby keep their time and try more teams in it. Blizzard runs also give the same answer every time now, so the search compares teams fairly there.":"过去搜索会对部分队伍以同一强度重复测试（涩谷无限的 118 次中有 12 次），每个模拟秒还会重算单位伤害。现在两者都会缓存。开场前或已开启传送门内的搜索约从 18 秒缩短至 12 秒，测试数量及选出的队伍不变；大厅搜索保留原时间预算，用于测试更多队伍。暴风雪模拟现在结果可复现，便于公平比较。","A second Windsong cast adds nothing while the buff is up, and doesn't renew it either, so a cast fired a moment early was wasted. Each copy now reads the buff on your units and casts only once it has really ended.":"Windsong 增益仍在时，再次施法既不叠加也不续时，稍早释放就会浪费。现在每个副本读取单位上的增益，仅在其真正结束后施放。","A skin counts only in the Hunt, on the unit wearing it. You hold: none.\nNothing to sell.\nSunny Stars: 0 opened. A sure Mythic unit in 400 more (60.0k pearls).\nWants a Mythic unit you don't have (Armored Crusader, Fishi, Water Goddess), but that would go under the 105.0k pearls you keep.":"皮肤只在狩猎中对穿戴它的单位生效。你持有：无。\n暂无可出售物品。\n夏日星：已开启 0 个，再开 400 个必得神话单位（需 60.0k 珍珠）。\n希望获得尚未持有的神话单位（Armored Crusader、Fishi、Water Goddess），但这会低于你保留的 105.0k 珍珠。","A slow or a stun now counts for what it does for your other units, not just its own damage, so Mochi goes down early. And the simulator weighs upgrades the way the farm does, so it buys in nearly the same order.":"减速和眩晕单位现在按对其他队员的帮助估值，而非仅看自身伤害，因此 Mochi 会更早放置。模拟器也按自动刷取的方式评估升级，购买顺序更接近实际。","A swap of two units could fail without a word and leave the wrong team on. The farm now checks and tries again.":"交换两个单位曾可能无提示失败，导致装备错误队伍；现在会检查并重试。","A takedown needs a hit before the enemy dies, so the trainee stands where enemies arrive first and goes for the newest enemy in its range, one your other units haven't killed yet.":"击杀训练需要在敌人死亡前命中，因此训练单位会站在敌人最先到达的位置，优先攻击射程内刚出现、尚未被其他队员击杀的敌人。","A takedown-training check cut short by a teleport no longer counts as \"no\" for 6 hours: it's checked again.":"被传送中断的击杀训练检测不再视为失败并搁置 6 小时，而会重新检测。","A team can hold one Miracle Timepiece, so a second unit carrying one was turned away, leaving an empty slot. It takes its relic off for that team now.":"每支队伍只能携带一件奇迹时计；过去第二个携带者被拒绝，导致空位。现在会为该队伍卸下其遗物。","A team that can't win the Hunt yet no longer replays it over and over. What only a win pays (a new bingo square, a new weather, the first Explosion Mage) now counts at the real chance of winning, where it used to count on every run, lost ones too. The pearls still count in full, as they come on a loss too.":"尚不能打赢狩猎的队伍不再反复重开。仅胜利才给的奖励（新宾果格、新天气、首个 Explosion Mage）现在按真实胜率折算，过去连败局也算在内；失败也会给的珍珠仍全额计入。","A unit that freezes, stuns or slows holds what's in its own range, so it now goes where your other attackers' damage reaches the road the most, and what it holds stays under all of them. Snow Reaper's copies used to go where the road was longest, sometimes 120 studs from anyone else. Control that only comes at a later upgrade counts too now: Ghost Lady (Princess) from upgrade 3, JIO from 4, Delinquent (The Universe) from 7.":"冰冻、眩晕和减速只作用于自身射程，因此控制单位现在放在其他输出覆盖路线最多的位置，让被控敌人持续受到集火。过去 Snow Reaper 有时被放在离队友 120 格、仅路线较长的位置。后续升级才解锁的控制也会计入：Ghost Lady (Princess) 第 3 次升级、JIO 第 4 次、Delinquent (The Universe) 第 7 次。","Abilities:":"技能：","Ability hold":"技能保留","Accent":"强调色","Accuracy:":"准确度：","Activity":"活动","Adaptive Size":"自适应大小","After a win the farm presses Next instead of going back to the lobby. The team is sorted out at the start of the next match, before the first wave: your training unit stays in if the simulator says the team still wins there, otherwise your own team goes back. It still stops at the lobby when the Units → Upgrades has work.":"胜利后点击“下一关”，不再返回大厅。下一场第一波前整理队伍：模拟认为携带训练单位仍能获胜就保留，否则恢复原队伍。“单位 → 强化”有任务时仍会停在大厅。","All accounts":"全部账号","Allow your portals even if the simulator predicts a loss.":"即使模拟器预测失败，也允许使用你持有的传送门。","Animations":"动画","Anti-AFK":"防挂机断线","Any unit can now hit flyers, for half damage and without its stun or slow unless it stands on a hill or has an anti-air attack. The simulator and the buying both play it that way.":"现在任何单位都能对飞行敌人造成一半伤害，但除非站在高台或具备对空攻击，否则不附带眩晕或减速。模拟器与购买决策均遵守此规则。","Appearance":"外观","Artifact Stage":"神器关卡","Artifact Stage saved value":"神器关卡已保存值","At the start of a match (your own team, not Infinite or Fool's Hunt) the simulator tries spots on the map for each attacker and uses the layout that gets furthest against tough enemies. Each unit's shortlist counts the road it reaches at full range with the run's bonuses: Iron Sentinel went from reaching 72% of a road to all of it. A spot that lost on a map counts against it next time. Battle → Planner.":"开局时（使用自有队伍，非无限或愚者狩猎），模拟器为各攻击单位测试地图位置，选择在强敌下推进最远的布局。候选点考虑本局加成后的完整射程覆盖：Iron Sentinel 的道路覆盖曾从 72% 提高到全部。地图上导致失败的位置，下次会降低优先级。位于“战斗 → 规划器”。","Auto Abilities":"自动释放技能","Auto Farm":"自动刷取","Auto Load Config":"自动加载配置","Auto Place":"自动放置","Auto Rewards":"自动领取奖励","Auto Start":"自动开始","Auto Summon":"自动召唤","Auto Summon pulls the next 10 as soon as the last ones land, where it waited 5 s between pulls, and looks every 30 s instead of every 2 minutes. Fuse For XP feeds 50 units at a time, batch after batch, where it fed 20 every 20 s (20 a time if the game won't take 50). Your Keep lines, Summons Per Visit and the level cap still hold.":"自动召唤在上一批结果到达后立即再抽 10 次，不再间隔 5 秒；检查频率由每 2 分钟改为每 30 秒。经验融合由每 20 秒喂 20 个改为连续每批 50 个；游戏拒绝 50 个时退回每批 20 个。资源保留量、每次到访召唤次数及等级上限仍有效。","Auto Upgrade":"自动升级","Auto limit break core":"自动突破核心单位","Auto-Equip Best Team used to go by a saved plan, even one made hours ago with different units. Now it searches before every run with the units and levels you have right then.":"自动装备最佳队伍过去使用已保存计划，可能是数小时前按旧单位生成的。现在每局开始前都按当前持有单位和等级重新搜索。","Autoload mode":"自动加载模式","Automatic upgrades":"自动强化","Automation status":"自动化状态","Available fodder":"可用素材单位","Background":"背景","Background Opacity":"背景不透明度","Banner":"卡池","Banner saved value":"卡池已保存值","Banner snipe":"定向抽取","Battle":"战斗","Battle automation":"战斗自动化","Before a mode has any real runs, the farm used to give it a hopeful chance, so it got one run to check the simulator. A weak team then tried every big-reward mode once and lost them all. Now, when the simulator's team loses even against enemies at a quarter of their health, the farm skips that mode, and wins elsewhere instead.":"过去缺乏实测的模式会得到乐观胜率，用一次对局验证，导致弱队逐个尝试高奖励模式并全部失败。现在若模拟队伍连四分之一生命值的敌人都打不过，就跳过该模式，改去能取胜的地方。","Before a run, your relics move to where they add the most damage on the team that's playing, counting what each copy really rolled: its damage types, the Timepiece's extra hit on slow attackers, crit, flyers. Once a team has them, they only move again for +2% or more. Units → Upgrades.":"每局前按实际遗物属性，为当前队伍分配最大伤害收益的位置，考虑伤害类型、时计对慢攻单位的额外攻击、暴击和飞行敌人。完成分配后，仅收益达到 2% 以上才再次移动。位于“单位 → 强化”。","Before each room the farm tries your other units against that room. A new team goes on only if it holds up clearly better, and the rooms a team has really won or lost count too.":"每个房间前测试其他单位，只有新队伍明显更能坚持才更换，并同时参考该队伍实际通关或失败的房间记录。","Before the first wave the simulator searches the best spots on the map for three layouts and picks by how strong your team is there. Beats enemies at 1.5× strength from the road's start: a fast clear. Beats a bit more than normal strength: spread over the road. Normal strength or lower: a kill box at the road's end, now with its own best spots. It works in every mode, dungeon rooms too, except Infinite and modes that deal your team. A layout that loses steps down to a safer one on the next try, and a room's last life is always a kill box.":"第一波前，模拟器为三种布局寻找最佳位置，再按队伍强度选择。能在路口击败 1.5 倍强度敌人时快速清场；略高于普通强度时沿路分散；普通或更低强度时在终点集中火力，该布局也有专属最佳位置。适用于地牢等模式，无限及系统发放队伍的模式除外。失败后下次采用更稳妥的布局；房间最后一条生命始终使用集中火力区。","Begin another dungeon after the current run ends.":"当前探索结束后开始新一轮地牢。","Best target: — (your strongest unit; level cap 100 → 110 ≈ +20% damage after levelling, and +5% damage for your whole team). Needs 12 fuel points: you have 0 in unlocked Mythic/Secret units (+0 in locked ones) and 0 Divine Wish. It destroys the fuel units, so the farm never does it — the Unit Fusion NPC does it when you choose.":"最佳目标：—（最强单位；等级上限 100 → 110，升级后伤害约 +20%，全队约 +5%）。需要 12 点素材：未锁定神话／秘密单位提供 0 点（已锁定单位另有 0 点），持有神圣愿望 0 个。素材会被销毁，因此自动刷取不会执行；需由你在单位融合 NPC 处确认。","Best team:":"最佳队伍：","Bring a trainee when the rest of the team can win.":"其余队员能够取胜时，带上一名训练单位。","Buffs while the team fights, damage abilities for a boss or a crowd":"战斗期间提供增益，面对首领或敌群时使用伤害技能","Buy XP food":"购买经验食物","Buy efficient XP food while preserving your gold floor.":"在保留金币下限的前提下，购买高性价比经验食物。","Buys a goal's item in the raid shop once you have enough raid items":"突袭材料足够时，在突袭商店购买目标所需物品","Buys evolve material from the daily gold shop":"从每日金币商店购买进化材料","Buys farm units while they pay back and the defense holds":"能够回本且守住防线时，购买经济单位","Buys the farm unit and its upgrades only while they pay back before the match ends and enemies die early on the road; otherwise it buys damage.":"仅当经济单位及其升级能在本局结束前回本，且敌人能在路线前段被消灭时才购买，否则优先购买输出。","Card Pick":"卡牌选择","Card Pick saved value":"卡牌选择已保存值","Chain runs":"连续挑战","Challenge":"挑战","Challenge rules":"挑战规则","Challenges":"挑战","Challenges saved value":"挑战已保存值","Choose a target in Units → Fusion":"在“单位 → 融合”中选择目标","Choose a target or banner, set reserves, then enable summons.":"选择目标或卡池，设置保留资源，再启用召唤。","Choose an evolution target. Its items and takedowns take priority.":"选择进化目标，其所需物品和击杀训练将获得优先级。","Choose charm automatically":"自动选择护符","Choose how the farm takes the Hunt's cards, on the Farm → Stages. Secret Luck (the default) takes the card with the most secret luck, then the most pay. Gems takes the card that pays the most. Easiest Win takes the one that makes your team strongest. Smart weighs pay against strength, as before. Except on Easiest Win, a card that would leave your team too weak to win is never taken.":"在“刷取 → 关卡”选择狩猎卡牌策略。默认“秘密单位幸运”优先幸运最高、其次奖励最高；“宝石”优先最高收益；“最容易获胜”选择队伍最强的卡；“智能”如过去一样权衡奖励与强度。除“最容易获胜”外，任何会让队伍过弱而失去胜算的卡都不会选。","Choose modes, start runs and play automatically.":"选择模式、开始对局并自动游玩。","Chuuni (Delusion) targets the strongest enemy so the boss keeps her mark; Legendary Assassin (Prime) targets the closest and stands near the exit.":"Chuuni (Delusion) 优先攻击最强敌人，让首领持续携带标记；Legendary Assassin (Prime) 优先攻击最近目标，并站在出口附近。","Clear":"清除","Clear all":"全部清除","Clear the lobby hold and allow match starts.":"解除大厅停留，允许开始对局。","Click a row to select a unit. ★ marks the farm's safe picks; ⚠ marks something worth keeping. Empty selection uses the farm's safe rule. Locked and equipped units never show.":"点击一行选择单位。★ 表示自动刷取认为可安全消耗，⚠ 表示值得保留；不选择时遵循默认安全规则。已锁定或已装备单位不会显示。","Cluster units near the exit during repeated daily runs.":"反复进行每日挑战时，将单位集中放在出口附近。","Codes:":"兑换码：","Community Tips":"社区建议","Completed runs":"已完成对局","Config Name:":"配置名称：","Consume eligible units up to the target's level cap.":"消耗符合条件的单位，将目标提升至等级上限。","Control how the farm fights. Team predictions are under Planner.":"控制自动战斗方式；队伍预测位于“规划器”。","Control placement and upgrades inside a match.":"控制对局内的放置与升级。","Controls":"控制","Copy code":"复制代码","Core units":"核心单位","Corner Radius":"圆角半径","Create":"创建","Crowd control holds the front, heavy hitters take the boss":"控制单位守住前线，高伤害单位对付首领","Currency reserve":"保留货币","Current goal":"当前目标","Current run":"当前对局","Cursed Festival Raid: The Temple Demon · 0% win · ≈0 gems/min\nraid: 30 gems + items · sim: loses at wave 3 of 20, even against enemies at a quarter of their health":"诅咒祭典突袭：神殿恶魔 · 胜率 0% · 约 0 宝石/分钟\n突袭：30 宝石＋物品 · 模拟：即使敌人生命值降至四分之一，仍在 20 波中的第 3 波失败","DETAILS":"详情","Daily Challenge":"每日挑战","Daily Challenge, the half-hour Challenge, first clears (Normal and Hard), raids, Fool's Hunt and farming, ranked by gems per minute from the game's own rewards and your real run times.":"每日挑战、每半小时挑战、普通与困难首次通关、突袭、愚者狩猎及刷取模式，按游戏实际奖励和你的真实对局时间计算每分钟宝石并排名。","Daily challenge":"每日挑战","Daily kill box":"每日挑战集中火力区","Daily login, finished quests, battle pass and first-clear milestones are claimed for you.":"自动领取每日登录、已完成任务、战令及首次通关里程碑奖励。","Daily login, finished quests, battle pass, milestones":"每日登录、已完成任务、战令、里程碑","Danger Road":"危险路段","Default":"默认","Default theme: none":"默认主题：无","Defense thresholds":"防御阈值","Delete":"删除","Density":"密度","Dim":"暗淡","Drag Style":"拖动样式","Dungeon":"地牢","Dungeon Room Value":"地牢房间收益估值","Dungeon room 1/20 · 94% win · ≈19 gems/min\nFabled Kingdom (coins) · 5 lives · 0 coins · chests 0 + 0 rare":"地牢房间 1/20 · 胜率 94% · 约 19 宝石/分钟\n传说王国（金币）· 5 条生命 · 0 金币 · 宝箱 0 个＋稀有宝箱 0 个","Dungeon room 1/20: not simulated yet":"地牢房间 1/20：尚未模拟","Dungeon saved value":"地牢已保存值","Dynamic Island":"灵动岛","Each match records how much of the damage each unit dealt (Iron Sentinel's drones count as its). The Units → Upgrades weighs every change by that.":"每局记录各单位造成的伤害占比（Iron Sentinel 的无人机伤害归入本体），“单位 → 强化”据此评估每项改动。","Each unit goes where it covers the most road. Spots the server refuses are remembered per map.":"每个单位放在可覆盖最多路线的位置；服务器拒绝的位置会按地图记忆。","Economy":"经济","Economy:":"经济：","Enable XP fusion":"启用经验融合","Enable limit break":"启用突破","Enabled":"已启用","Enabled modes compete by rewards. Only this mode restricts the farm; Disabled skips a mode.":"已启用的模式按奖励竞争；“仅此模式”限制刷取范围，“关闭”则跳过该模式。","Ending an Infinite run sells every unit once and skips any the game refuses (a golden Bulby held the old loop for 14 minutes).":"结束无限模式时，每个单位只尝试出售一次，跳过被游戏拒绝的单位；此前金色 Bulby 曾导致循环卡住 14 分钟。","Enemies on Legend Stages and some raids take much more damage from certain types, up to ×3.5 for some. The team search, the simulator and the buying now all count that, so a fire and ice stage gets your fire and ice units.":"传说关卡与部分突袭的敌人，对特定类型的伤害承受更高，部分可达 ×3.5。队伍搜索、模拟器和购买决策现均计入，因此火与冰关卡会采用你的火冰单位。","Enemies that heal, enemies that split when they die and enemies with barriers are now played too, so it sees the rooms that are really hard.":"模拟器现在也会模拟治疗敌人、死亡后分裂的敌人及带屏障的敌人，更准确识别困难房间。","Epic":"史诗","Equip planned team":"装备规划队伍","Equip the best team found in the lobby.":"装备在大厅中找到的最佳队伍。","Equip useful skins and sell spare ones listed here.":"装备有用的皮肤，并出售此处列出的多余皮肤。","Equipped units":"已装备单位","Events":"活动","Every Fool's Hunt run records the wave reached, the coins, the dealt units that carried the damage (placed first next time) and the hidden stats of every dealt unit. Units → Goals.":"每局愚者狩猎记录到达波次、金币、发放单位中的主要输出（下次优先放置），以及所有发放单位的隐藏属性。位于“单位 → 目标”。","Every enabled mode is available.":"所有启用的模式均可选择。","Every gold, gem and coin spend has a floor, a stop rule and a line in the Spending tab.":"每笔金币、宝石和活动币支出都有保留下限、停止规则，并记录在“支出”页。","Every summon on the map does +25% damage and reaches 10% further for each Zombie (Risen) placed, ×2 with all 4 down. The simulator now plays it on Iron Sentinel's drones and Elyssia's jellyfish and eels, and on the dead enemies Violentine (Brutal Angel) raises once a run has measured how much of hers they deal (the DAMAGE line now says what each unit's summons dealt), and both it and the match value another Zombie by a quarter of what your summons deal, measured live from their real damage. So the team search can pick it next to your summoners, and a match places all 4 when your summons are worth it.":"每放一个 Zombie (Risen)，地图上所有召唤物伤害 +25%、射程 +10%，放满 4 个则伤害翻倍。模拟器现支持 Iron Sentinel 无人机、Elyssia 水母与鳗鱼；实战测得伤害占比后，也支持 Violentine (Brutal Angel) 复活的敌人。DAMAGE 日志会显示各单位召唤物伤害。模拟器和实战都按召唤物实时伤害的四分之一评估新增 Zombie 的价值，因此会将其与召唤单位组队，并在收益足够时放满 4 个。","Every tab is reorganized and opens with what it's for. Home is the dashboard, with a line for every part. Play holds all the choices of what to play, one control per kind (Off, On or Only this) beside its map pick, where each kind used to have two switches. Summon and Fuse replace the old Lobby tab, and fine-tuning sits under Advanced at the bottom of each tab.":"全部标签页重新整理，开头说明用途。“主页”为各系统仪表盘；“游玩”汇总模式选择，各模式在地图旁仅保留“关闭／开启／仅此模式”一个控件，替代原有两个开关。“召唤”和“融合”替代旧大厅页；细调选项位于各页底部“高级”。","Evolution paths":"进化路线","Evolutions:":"进化：","Evolve:":"进化：","Evolves a ready unit when it gets stronger, using only spare items and copies":"只使用多余物品和重复单位，在就绪单位进化后能变强时自动进化","Evolves your best copy of a unit once it's ready and gets stronger, but only with items no bigger goal needs and only using up spare copies (never one on your team or with a trait). Every evolve shows in the log and the Spending tab. Switch it off in the Units → Goals.":"单位就绪且进化能变强时，进化你持有的最佳副本；仅使用更重要目标不需要的材料及多余副本，不消耗队伍成员或带特性的副本。每次进化记录在日志与支出页；可在“单位 → 目标”关闭。","Excluded challenges":"排除的挑战","FIX":"修复","FRAME RATE":"帧率","Fabled Kingdom (coins) · 5 lives · 0 coins · chests 0 + 0 rare":"传说王国（金币）· 5 条生命 · 0 金币 · 宝箱 0 个＋稀有宝箱 0 个","Farm":"刷取","Farm Story Only now plays only acts you've never beaten. Hard runs of acts you've already beaten on Normal wait, and come back when the switch is off.":"“仅刷剧情”现在只刷从未通关的章节；已普通通关章节的困难模式会等待，关闭此开关后恢复。","Farm Toward Goals":"围绕目标刷取","Farm Units":"经济单位","Farm Waves To Spare":"经济单位回本余量（波数）","Farm control":"刷取控制","Farm income":"经济收入","Farm picks":"自动推荐","Farm → Party: a switch for each mode the game matchmakes. The Daily (on, as before), raids (up to 6 players), Infinite and Legend Stages (up to 4) and the Summer Hunt (up to 6). Other players' units help, and outside the Daily the enemies get tougher with each player. If nobody joins in time, it plays alone.":"“刷取 → 组队”为游戏支持匹配的每种模式提供开关：每日挑战默认开，突袭最多 6 人，无限和传说关卡最多 4 人，夏日狩猎最多 6 人。其他玩家单位会协助战斗；每日挑战之外，敌人随人数增加而变强。超时无人加入则单人开始。","Farm → Stages: your portals go first even when the simulator says your team will lose there. Off by default.":"刷取 → 关卡：即使模拟器预测队伍会失败，也优先使用持有的传送门。默认关闭。","Feed XP food":"喂食经验食物","Fewer tabs, one home for every control, shorter descriptions and a new neon theme. Home shows what it's doing and what to play, Goals what it's working toward, Team what makes your units stronger, Lobby what you choose by hand.":"减少标签页，每项控制有固定归属，缩短说明，并采用新霓虹主题。“主页”显示当前行动和推荐模式，“目标”显示努力方向，“队伍”用于强化，“大厅”为手动选择。","Find a party for Infinite.":"为无限模式寻找队友。","Find a party for Legend Stages.":"为传说关卡寻找队友。","Find a party for raids.":"为突袭寻找队友。","Find a party for the current Summer Hunt.":"为当前夏日狩猎寻找队友。","Find players":"寻找玩家","Finish when another mode becomes more rewarding.":"其他模式收益更高时结束当前模式。","Fireflies":"萤火虫","Focus On saved value":"优先目标已保存值","Focus:":"重点：","Fodder selection":"素材选择","Fodder units":"素材单位","Forget measured unit damage":"清除已测量的单位伤害数据","Forget win rates and run times":"清除胜率与对局时间记录","Four things Fool's Hunt taught now work with your own team too (dungeons, challenges, story, raids): on the last wave each farm is sold and the yen goes into damage; once 5 units are down, at least 2 damage dealers guard the stretch before the base; once flyers show up (or a dungeon run carries the Curse of Flight), units that hit flyers get more of the yen; and short-range units get less of it, since a boss walks past them in a moment.":"从愚者狩猎学到的四项策略现也用于自有队伍的地牢、挑战、剧情和突袭：最后一波出售全部经济单位转为输出；放下 5 个单位后至少 2 个输出守在基地前；出现飞行敌人或地牢带飞行诅咒时，增加对空单位投入；短射程单位因首领很快经过，获得更少资源。","Fuse For XP now uses every unit up to the rarity you pick that isn't locked, including shiny, traited, levelled and farm units. It still never takes your team, your picks, a unit in takedown training or one wearing a relic. Lock a unit in the game to keep it.":"经验融合现可使用不高于所选稀有度的全部未锁定单位，包括闪光、带特性、已升级和经济单位。但仍排除队伍成员、手选保留单位、击杀训练单位及佩戴遗物的单位。想保留某单位，请在游戏内锁定。","Fuse for XP":"融合获取经验","Fuses now use the tier list's Fusion Fodder first. They never use your best supports, control units or farm, anything rated A or higher, a unit that evolves into one of those, or your 10 strongest units.":"融合优先使用评级表中的“融合素材”。不会使用最佳辅助、控制或经济单位、A 级及以上单位、能进化为这些单位的副本，或你最强的 10 个单位。","Fusion":"融合","Future City (Tyrant's Invasion) Raid: The Elite Bodyguard · 0% win · ≈0 gems/min\nraid: 30 gems + items · sim: loses at wave 3 of 20, even against enemies at a quarter of their health":"未来都市（暴君入侵）突袭：精英保镖 · 胜率 0% · 约 0 宝石/分钟\n突袭：30 宝石＋物品 · 模拟：即使敌人生命值降至四分之一，仍在 20 波中的第 3 波失败","Gem Banner When It Helps":"有助于提升队伍时抽取宝石卡池","Gems":"宝石","Gems Per 1% Team Damage":"每提升 1% 队伍伤害的宝石估值","Gems reserve":"保留宝石","General":"通用","Give food to the core unit that benefits most.":"将经验食物喂给收益最高的核心单位。","Go to":"前往","Goal Value":"目标价值","Goal priorities":"目标优先级","Goal summons":"目标召唤","Goals":"目标","Gold":"金币","Gold Floor":"金币下限","Gold Shop:":"金币商店：","Gold To Keep":"保留金币","Gold shop":"金币商店","Grows your strongest Fool's Hunt unit the way the guides do: a second copy goes down next to it and isn't upgraded, the first copy gets maxed, then Merge goes on the fresh copy so it keeps 1.5× the maxed one's damage and gets its own upgrades on top. Repeat for more. An Idol gets maxed early (it buffs everyone and makes upgrades cheaper).":"按攻略方式强化愚者狩猎中最强单位：在满升级的原单位旁放一个不升级的新副本，再将合并技能用于新副本，保留原单位 1.5 倍伤害，之后还能继续叠加自身升级；可重复操作。Idol 会尽早满升级，因为它增强全队并降低升级费用。","HOPELESS":"胜算极低","Her upgrades were hidden, so the team search skipped her. They now come from her wiki page, and the simulator plays her jellies and eels. Every unit's numbers were checked against its live page too.":"她的升级数据被隐藏，过去队伍搜索因此跳过她；现在采用其 Wiki 页面数据，并模拟水母与鳗鱼。其他所有单位数值也已按各自实时页面核对。","History":"历史","History tools":"历史工具","Home":"主页","Home tab: what the simulator expects of the run you're playing (a win or a loss, and at which wave), how the run is going against that at the start of every wave (ahead, on track or behind), how your units stand and why, the lane, and who does the damage. In the lobby, what it reads for the next mode.":"主页显示当前对局预测（胜负与结束波次）、每波开始时实际进度与预测的比较（领先／符合预期／落后）、各单位站位及原因、路线与伤害贡献。大厅则显示下一模式的预测。","IMPROVED":"改进","If the window opened before the game had loaded your units, the unit pickers on the Units → Fusion and Units → Summon could stay empty, and so could the fodder table. They now fill in as soon as your units are there, in a match too.":"若窗口在游戏加载单位前打开，“单位 → 融合”和“单位 → 召唤”的选择器及素材表可能一直为空。现在单位数据就绪即补全，对局内也有效。","Ignore portal win estimate":"忽略传送门胜率预测","Illusionist (Final)'s ability guards the base for 10 seconds and throws back what touches it, so the farm now fires it as an enemy reaches the base. It used to fire at 90% of the road, which spent nearly all of it before the enemy arrived.":"Illusionist (Final) 技能会守护基地 10 秒并弹回接触的敌人，因此现在敌人抵达基地才使用。过去在路线 90% 处就释放，敌人到来前几乎耗尽持续时间。","Import code":"导入代码","Improve your core units using available resources.":"利用现有资源强化核心单位。","In a dungeon the simulator now counts what the run carries: damage, cooldown and range items, a damage type's bonus (Mage Coat), and the curses that make enemies tougher. It used to simulate your team as if it had bought nothing, and called rooms it then won a loss.":"地牢模拟现在计入本轮携带的伤害、冷却和射程物品，伤害类型加成（如法师外套），以及增强敌人的诅咒。过去按未购物队伍模拟，可能把实战能赢的房间判为失败。","In a kill box every attacker now starts on a spot that really reaches the road's last stretch. A unit that stands on hills, like Iron Sentinel, has few spots near the end, and its list used to be filled up with mid-road ones: on the Summer Hunt it stood 100 studs from the other three, reaching 30-64% of the road and none of the box. The fast start works the same way now.":"集中火力区的每个攻击单位，现在起始位置都必须覆盖路线最后一段。Iron Sentinel 等高台单位在终点附近可选点少，过去候选被中段点挤满，夏日狩猎中曾离其他三名队员 100 格，仅覆盖路线 30–64%，完全不覆盖集火区。快速开局布局也采用此规则。","In a study run, the unit studied now uses its ability as soon as it's ready, so its report says what the ability does. Abilities used to wait for a boss, a crowd or an enemy at your base, which an easy study map never brings: Illusionist (Final)'s was used 0 times in 2 runs.":"研究局中的被研究单位现在技能就绪即释放，让报告体现技能效果。过去需等待首领、敌群或敌人到基地，而简单研究地图可能从不出现这些情况，Illusionist (Final) 曾在两局中释放 0 次。","In dungeon rooms your attackers stand together on the road's last stretch, and now the simulator plays them there too. It no longer calls a room lost at wave 7 when your team really gets to the boss, so its team picks and room picks go by what actually happens. Whether to take a curse is still judged the careful way.":"地牢里攻击单位集中站在道路末段，模拟器现也按同样站位计算，不再实战能打到首领却判第 7 波失败。组队与选房更贴合实战，是否接受诅咒仍沿用谨慎规则。","In the Summer Hunt the game already puts a Summer skin's damage boost into the unit's damage, and the simulator added it a second time. A Spirit Reaper in its +5000% skin read 51 times too strong, and Hunts the simulator called wins were lost at wave 13-24. Now it counts once.":"夏日狩猎已将夏日皮肤伤害加成写入单位伤害，过去模拟器再次叠加：+5000% 皮肤的 Spirit Reaper 曾被高估 51 倍，预测胜利却在第 13–24 波失败。现在只计算一次。","In the Summer Hunt's Blizzard, half the enemies are covered in Ice. The simulator used to guess that made every enemy 1.5× tougher. Now every other enemy comes in Ice and takes a third of the damage from anything but fire, as measured in real runs. On average that's about 2× tougher, and 3× on the Ice half.":"夏日狩猎暴风雪中，一半敌人附带寒冰。过去模拟器笼统按全体 1.5 倍强度估计；现在隔一个敌人附冰，按实测除火以外伤害只受三分之一，相当于寒冰半数约 3 倍难度，整体约 2 倍。","In the Summer Hunt's Starfall weather, Star Golems fall in, and the simulator didn't play them. Now each Starfall run counts them, and the simulator adds them from then on.":"夏日狩猎星陨天气会降下星之魔像，过去模拟器未计入。现在记录每次星陨局的魔像，并在此后模拟中加入。","Infinite":"无限模式","Infinite & Portals":"无限模式与传送门","Infinite Map saved value":"无限模式地图已保存值","Infinite map":"无限模式地图","Infinite maps join the ranking: each pays gems once a day at waves 10, 25 and 50 (200 in all), and a run lasts until the base falls, so a unit in training gets far more takedowns. The first quarter of the road is kept for that unit (your other attackers stand after it), and while enemies die early the others aren't upgraded, so enemies live long enough for it to hit them. Every map sends the same number of enemies; the easy ones last longest. Modes tab.":"无限地图加入收益排名：每张地图每天在第 10、25、50 波各发一次宝石，总计 200；对局持续到基地失守，因此训练单位可获得更多击杀。路线前四分之一留给训练单位，其他攻击单位站在其后；若敌人仍在前段被击杀，则暂不升级其他队员，保证训练者有时间命中。各地图敌人数相同，简单地图能坚持更久。位于“模式”页。","Infinite saved value":"无限模式已保存值","It can only work in the lobby, and won rooms used to chain straight into the next one, so it hardly ever got a turn. The run now goes through the lobby whenever the Units → Upgrades has something to do, and it finishes before the next room. Going through the lobby doesn't cost a choice of room.":"强化只能在大厅进行，过去地牢胜利后直接连到下一房间，几乎没有机会执行。现在“单位 → 强化”有任务时会经过大厅，完成后才进入下一房；经过大厅不消耗选房机会。","It now counts how many times an attack hits (shields lose a point per hit), plays slows and stuns on the road, and stops regen on bleeding enemies, so slow units like Mochi get the credit they earn.":"模拟器现计算攻击命中次数（护盾每次命中消耗一点），模拟道路上的减速和眩晕，并阻止流血敌人回血，让 Mochi 等减速单位获得合理评价。","It now plays Chuuni's marks, Iron Sentinel's drones, time stops, cooldown buffs, shield breaks and built-in crits, so those units get the credit they earn when it picks teams. Summons aren't played yet.":"现支持 Chuuni 标记、Iron Sentinel 无人机、时停、冷却增益、破盾和内置暴击，选队时可正确评估相关单位。其他召唤物暂未模拟。","Items that boost one damage type are now judged by how much of your damage is that type, not how many units are. An item that does nothing for your team isn't bought at any price.":"单一伤害类型加成物品现在按该类型占全队伤害的比例估值，而非单位数量占比。对队伍没有效果的物品，无论多便宜都不会购买。","Items your best goals need get a gem value, so the farm goes after them":"为最佳目标所需物品赋予宝石估值，引导刷取","Keep pulling until the target drops or a budget is reached.":"持续抽取，直到获得目标或达到预算上限。","Label":"标签","Leave Infinite once training and nearby daily gems are done.":"训练及近期可获的每日宝石完成后，退出无限模式。","Leave after daily gems":"获得每日宝石后退出","Leave this run and hold future match starts.":"离开当前对局并暂停后续开局。","Legacy gems reserve":"旧版宝石保留量","Legend Stage To Play now has Progress too: the next legend stage you haven't beaten, in the game's order.":"传说关卡选择新增“推进度”：按游戏顺序选择下一个尚未通关的传说关卡。","Legend Stage saved value":"传说关卡已保存值","Legend Stages":"传说关卡","Legend Stages saved value":"传说关卡已保存值","Legend stage":"传说关卡","Legend stages":"传说关卡","Limit Break:":"突破：","Limit break":"突破","Live log":"实时日志","Load":"加载","Loads the selected config on launch":"启动时加载所选配置","Log":"日志","Log Level":"日志等级","Log Level saved value":"日志等级已保存值","Logging":"日志记录","Logs":"日志","Look for players before starting the daily.":"开始每日挑战前寻找队友。","Manage event skins":"管理活动皮肤","Match:":"对局：","Maximum fodder rarity":"素材最高稀有度","Menu":"菜单","Merge:":"合并：","Midnight":"午夜","Minimize UI on Start":"启动时最小化界面","Minimum win chance":"最低胜率","Mirrors log lines to the executor console":"将日志同步到执行器控制台","Mode priorities":"模式优先级","Mode ranking":"模式排名","Mode selection":"模式选择","Mode:":"模式：","Modes":"模式","Moves relics to where they add the most damage for the team that's playing":"为当前队伍重新分配遗物，以获得最大伤害提升","Muted text":"次要文字","NEW":"新增","New clears":"首次通关","Next mode:":"下个模式：","Next run":"下次对局","Nightmare Train Raid: Demonic Invasion · 0% win · ≈0 gems/min\nraid: 75 gems + items · 3/3 tries left · sim: loses at wave 3 of 20, even against enemies at a quarter of their health":"噩梦列车突袭：恶魔入侵 · 胜率 0% · 约 0 宝石/分钟\n突袭：75 宝石＋物品 · 剩余 3/3 次 · 模拟：即使敌人生命值降至四分之一，仍在 20 波中的第 3 波失败","No evolution that would join your team is waiting on takedowns.":"将加入队伍的进化目标均无需等待击杀数。","No more study runs after the one going now. Your own team goes back in":"当前研究局结束后不再继续，并换回你的原队伍","No results":"无结果","No supported event is currently available.":"当前没有支持的活动。","None":"无","Normal":"普通","Nothing here yet":"此处暂无内容","Nothing logged yet":"暂无日志","Nothing ready yet — the farm is collecting the items":"暂无就绪目标，正在收集物品","Nothing to do: every core unit is as strong as what you have allows.":"暂无可执行操作：现有资源已将全部核心单位提升到可达强度。","On a study run's last wave the whole team now fights.":"研究局最后一波现在由整支队伍共同作战。","On the Units → Fusion: pick any unit that can still be limit broken, then tick its fodder in a table that shows each unit's rarity, level, points, evolved, trait, relic, shine and whether a goal needs it. ★ marks the farm's own safe picks, and a card shows level, Divine Wish and fodder points with a progress bar. Nothing ticked: the farm picks by its safe rule as before.":"“单位 → 融合”：选择仍可突破的单位，再在素材表勾选；表格显示稀有度、等级、点数、进化、特性、遗物、闪光及目标是否需要它。★ 为自动推荐的安全素材，信息卡用进度条显示等级、神圣愿望和素材点数。未勾选时仍按默认安全规则选择。","On the last wave with only a boss or two left, new units and upgrades go where the boss is. An attacker it has walked past is sold, and when the boss would reach your base alive (a Curse of Regen boss heals 1% of its HP a second), units waiting further down the road move up to it too, so all your damage lands together.":"最后一波仅剩一两个首领时，新单位和升级投入首领当前位置；首领已走过的攻击单位会被出售。若首领仍可能活着到达基地（再生诅咒首领每秒恢复 1% 生命），后方等待的单位也会上前集火，确保伤害同时生效。","One switch to play, and five you can use to play only raids, story progress, challenges, April Coins or dungeons. All off: it plays whatever pays best.":"一个总开关启动自动游玩，另有五个开关用于仅刷突袭、剧情推进、挑战、四月币或地牢。全部关闭则选择收益最高的模式。","Only while a featured unit would beat your weakest team unit. Spends gems":"仅当卡池精选单位优于队伍中最弱单位时才花费宝石","Open Sunny Stars":"开启夏日星","Outline":"描边","PICK":"选择","PING":"延迟","POINTS":"积分","Party":"组队","Party wait":"等待队友","Past wave 50 an Infinite run pays only a few gems a wave. Once the daily gems are in and no unit is training there, the farm ends the run if another mode pays more a minute: it sells your units, the base falls and the run pays out as usual. Modes tab.":"无限模式第 50 波后，每波只给少量宝石。已领取每日宝石且没有训练单位时，如果其他模式每分钟收益更高，就出售单位让基地失守并正常结算。位于“模式”页。","Pearls":"珍珠","Pearls reserve":"保留珍珠","Pick The Core Units Again":"重新选择核心单位","Pick a banner":"选择卡池","Pick a banner to summon on, a unit to fuse to, a unit and grade for its stats, and a unit to evolve (it farms the items and takedowns first). Each stays off until you switch it on.":"可选择召唤卡池、经验融合目标、属性目标与等级，以及进化目标（先刷取材料和击杀数）。各功能只有手动开启后才运行。","Pick a banner. It stops at the line below, or when your unit storage is full.":"选择卡池；达到下方保留阈值或单位仓库已满时停止。","Pick a unit":"选择单位","Pick a unit below. It's pulled on whichever banner features it, until it drops or a Keep line below is reached.\nBanners turn over next at 16:00 (expected)\nGems 760 · Pearls 0 · Legacy Gems 0 · pulled so far: 0":"在下方选择单位；会在其作为精选角色的任一卡池抽取，直到获得或达到下方保留阈值。\n预计下次卡池轮换：16:00\n宝石 760 · 珍珠 0 · 旧版宝石 0 · 已抽取：0","Pick a unit to chase (Settings: pull goal, e.g. Chuuni, SS once evolved). The farm plays Fool's Hunt for AprilCoins while the goal needs them, pulls the April banner 10 at a time until it drops, keeps its evolve item's price, buys that item, trains its takedowns and evolves it. Units → Goals.":"选择追求的单位（设置：召唤目标，例如进化后 SS 级的 Chuuni）。目标仍需要四月币时，自动刷愚者狩猎，每次十连抽四月卡池直到获得单位，同时保留进化物品费用，再购买材料、训练击杀数并进化。位于“单位 → 目标”。","Pick a unit to limit break above, and the units it could use show here.:":"在上方选择突破单位，此处将显示可用素材：","Pick a unit, or Smart. The farm reads its passives and ability, plays real matches with it, and saves what it learned locally.":"选择单位或“智能”。脚本读取其被动和技能，用实际对局研究，并将结果保存到本地。","Pick a unit. Fusing limit breaks it (level cap 100 → 110), and destroys the units it uses.":"选择单位进行突破（等级上限 100 → 110），所用素材单位会被销毁。","Pick a unit. It gets the XP of the spare units fused into it, and those units are destroyed.":"选择单位，将多余单位融合为其经验；素材单位会被销毁。","Pick any unit a banner can feature. Each lobby visit reads every banner, and while one features your pick it pulls there until the unit drops, or until your gems, pearls or Legacy Gems reach the Keep line you set. Banners turn over every 4 hours: a match can't read them, but the farm knows when they've changed and stops at the lobby after the match to look. It replaces Griffin Watch (a watch that was on carries on for Griffin). Units → Summon.":"可选择任一卡池可能精选的单位。每次到大厅都会读取全部卡池；若有目标则抽取，直到获得或宝石、珍珠、旧版宝石达到设定保留线。卡池每 4 小时轮换，对局中读不到卡池，但脚本知道轮换时间，结束后会停在大厅查看。此功能替代 Griffin 监视；原本已开启的监视会继续追踪 Griffin。位于“单位 → 召唤”。","Placement:":"放置：","Plan Best Teams":"规划最佳队伍","Planner":"规划器","Planner tools":"规划器工具","Players":"玩家","Playing:":"正在游玩：","Plays a mode with your team before the farm spends a run on it: the game's own enemy HP, waves and yen, and the farm's own buying. It learns from every real match.":"正式投入一次对局前，先用你的队伍模拟该模式，采用游戏实际敌人生命、波次和日元，以及自动刷取自己的购买决策，并从每场实战继续学习。","Plays the team the mode deals (not yours): places each dealt card, casts Random Buff on your strongest unit, Clone and Astral Summon, picks the AprilCoin multipliers, and at 20 units sells a weak unit for a much stronger card (or discards a card that isn't worth a spot). A Refund card cashes in a farm that won't earn back its cost before the run ends, or a weak unit whose yen buys far more damage as upgrades. Extra copies of a spell card are discarded so the hand keeps room for units.":"使用模式发放的队伍而非你的队伍：放置每张单位卡，对最强单位释放随机增益，并使用克隆和星界召唤；选择四月币倍率。达到 20 个单位后，为明显更强的卡出售弱单位，否则弃掉不值得占位的卡。退款卡用于在结束前回不了本的经济单位，或可换成更高升级伤害的弱单位。重复法术卡会被弃掉，为单位留出手牌空间。","Portal":"传送门","Portal saved value":"传送门已保存值","Portals":"传送门","Portals come in tiers, and each one you hold is now read the way its Portal Analysis shows it: Tier, how much tougher its enemies are, its reward multiplier, lanes, the host's Limited Star Remnants, and its own weak and strong types. Each tier you hold is judged on its own, simulated at its own strength, and its payout counts its reward multiplier. Within a tier, the farm opens the portal whose types suit your team best.":"持有的每个传送门现在按其“传送门分析”读取：层级、敌人强度、奖励倍率、路线、房主限定星之残片，以及自身弱点与抗性类型。每个层级独立评估、按真实强度模拟并计入奖励倍率。同层级优先开启属性最适合当前队伍的传送门。","Portals had a plain switch where every other kind on the Farm → Stages has three choices. Now it has the same three: On plays the portals you hold ahead of other kinds when a goal needs their drops (or your pick whenever you hold one), Only this plays just portals, and Off never opens one.":"传送门原来只有普通开关，现在与“刷取 → 关卡”其他模式一致：开启时，在目标需要掉落物或持有所选类型时优先挑战；“仅此模式”只打传送门；关闭则不打开。","Portals saved value":"传送门已保存值","Prediction":"预测","Prefer rewards when strong enough, damage when needed.":"强度足够时优先奖励，否则优先伤害。","Preset":"预设","Preview upgrades only":"仅预览强化","Print To Console":"输出到控制台","Prioritize the daily challenge until it is won.":"优先每日挑战，直到获胜。","Profiles":"配置","Promo codes from the guides, at most once a day":"来自攻略的兑换码，每天最多兑换一次","Put your original team back in the lobby.":"在大厅换回你的原队伍。","Raid":"突袭","Raid Shop For Goals":"为目标购买突袭商店物品","Raid saved value":"突袭已保存值","Raids":"突袭","Raids & Dungeon":"突袭与地牢","Raids saved value":"突袭已保存值","Reads its passives and ability, then plays the runs (the Auto Farm has to be on)":"读取被动和技能后进行实际对局（需要开启自动刷取）","Ready to evolve":"可进化","Recalculate plan":"重新计算方案","Recommendations":"建议","Redeem Codes":"兑换代码","Redeems the promo codes from the guides in the lobby, each one your account hasn't used.":"在大厅兑换攻略提供的、此账号尚未使用的兑换码。","Refresh":"刷新","Relics & limit breaks":"遗物与突破","Rename":"重命名","Repeat summons":"重复召唤","Repeat until daily win":"持续直到每日挑战获胜","Replay and Next can now restart right where you are. The farm reloads itself on the spot, about 5 seconds, and can still change the team before the first wave. If the game teleports instead, it works as before.":"“重玩”和“下一关”现在可原地重启，自动刷取约 5 秒内重新加载，且第一波前仍可换队。若游戏采用传送方式，则保持原有流程。","Replays restart in place without the lobby, so they kept the team that went in, even when a Summer Hunt replay brought a new map and weather. Now a replay gets a short search before its first wave, on the match's own map and weather, like the next story act already did. A map where the simulator is far off real runs still sends back the team that won there last, and the log now says that's what happened.":"原地重玩不经过大厅，过去即使夏日狩猎换地图和天气也沿用旧队伍。现在重玩会在第一波前，按本局地图与天气执行简短搜索，和剧情下一章相同。某地图模拟与实测偏差很大时，仍恢复上次在该图获胜的队伍，日志也会明确说明。","Require win estimate":"要求胜率预测","Requirements":"需求","Reset":"重置","Reset Mode Stats":"重置模式统计","Reset Unit Learning":"重置单位学习","Rest After Losses":"连败后休息","Restore my team":"恢复我的队伍","Resume after lobby hold":"解除大厅停留后继续","Return to lobby":"返回大厅","Return when trained":"训练完成后返回","Rewards:":"奖励：","RobScript Team - Anime Adventures":"RobScript Team - 动漫冒险","RobScript Team - Anime Adventures · v2.0":"RobScript Team - 动漫冒险 · v2.0","Room 1/20 · 5 lives · 0 coins · chests 0 + 0 rare · luck ×1.0\nItems: none · Curses: none\nThey add up to: none\nNext: Fabled Kingdom (coins), win ≈94%\n15:34 new dungeon run started (4 lives)":"房间 1/20 · 5 条生命 · 0 金币 · 宝箱 0 个＋稀有宝箱 0 个 · 幸运 ×1.0\n物品：无 · 诅咒：无\n总效果：无\n下个目标：传说王国（金币），胜率约 94%\n15:34 开始新的地牢探索（4 条生命）","Rules":"规则","Run the simulator and team search in the lobby.":"在大厅运行模拟器与队伍搜索。","Running":"运行中","Safe Kill Time":"安全击杀时间","Safe Road":"安全路段","Sand Village Raid: Midnight Attack · 0% win · ≈0 gems/min\nraid: 75 gems + items · 3/3 tries left · sim: loses at wave 3 of 20, even against enemies at a quarter of their health":"沙之村突袭：午夜袭击 · 胜率 0% · 约 0 宝石/分钟\n突袭：75 宝石＋物品 · 剩余 3/3 次 · 模拟：即使敌人生命值降至四分之一，仍在 20 波中的第 3 波失败","Sand Village Raid: Midnight Attack: loses at wave 3 of 20, even against enemies at a quarter of their health":"沙之村突袭：午夜袭击：即使敌人生命值降至四分之一，仍在 20 波中的第 3 波失败","Save":"保存","Save Settings":"保存设置","Save Threshold":"保存阈值","Saved profiles":"已保存配置","Screen":"屏幕","Script":"脚本","Search":"搜索","Search For Best Spots":"寻找最佳放置点","Secret Luck":"秘密单位幸运","Select a target and review its fodder before enabling fusion. Used units are consumed.":"先选择目标并查看素材，再启用融合。所用单位将被消耗。","Select all":"全选","Selection: Smart · enabled modes\nNext: Dungeon room 1/20":"选择：智能 · 已启用模式\n下个目标：地牢房间 1/20","Selection: Smart · enabled modes\nNext: Sand Village Raid: Midnight Attack":"选择：智能 · 已启用模式\n下个目标：沙之村突袭：午夜袭击","Selection: Smart · enabled modes\nNext: waiting for an eligible stage":"选择：智能 · 已启用模式\n下个目标：等待符合条件的关卡","Sends an input when Roblox flags you idle":"Roblox 判定挂机时发送输入","Session":"会话","Set":"设置","Set Default":"设为默认","Settings":"设置","Shibuya's portal lists 20 waves, but every real run ends at wave 15, like a dungeon room. The simulator played all 20, with twice as much enemy health in the last 5 as in the 15 real ones, so every portal reading came out harder than the real thing. Now it plays 15, and in the match wave 15 is the last one: your farm units are cashed in for damage there, where the farm used to wait for a wave 20 that never came. A portal whose real runs go past 15 plays its whole list.":"涩谷传送门列表显示 20 波，但实际如地牢一样在第 15 波结束。过去模拟全部 20 波，且额外五波总生命值是前 15 波的两倍，导致预测过难。现在模拟 15 波，并在第 15 波出售经济单位转为输出，不再等待不存在的第 20 波。实战确实超过 15 波的传送门仍按完整列表模拟。","Show on Hover":"悬停时显示","Show the plan without spending resources.":"只展示方案，不花费资源。","Shows which evolutions your items already cover and what each one would change in the hardest mode you play.":"显示现有物品可支持的进化，以及各进化对当前最难模式的影响。","Simulates each mode before playing it, and ranks by the odds":"游玩前模拟各模式，并按胜算排名","Skins & stars":"皮肤与星","Skip Summon Animations":"跳过召唤动画","Skip These Challenges saved value":"跳过挑战已保存值","Skip challenges below the win chance set here.":"跳过胜率低于此阈值的挑战。","Smart":"智能","Smart Evolve":"智能进化","Smart Play: goals are worked out in the lobby":"智能游玩：在大厅规划目标","Smart Relics":"智能遗物","Smart Targeting":"智能索敌","Smart: whatever pays best (Farm → Stages)":"智能：选择收益最高的模式（刷取 → 关卡）","Snipe budget":"定向抽取预算","Snipe target":"定向抽取目标","Snipe:":"定向抽取：","Snow Reaper (Final)'s Gale of the Moon is a switch with a bar: while it's on, enemies in her range are slowed, chilled and frozen. The farm used to flip it on and off every few seconds. Now her copies take turns: the next one goes on as the one running empties, a copy with nothing in range switches off to keep its bar, and while one copy is on a boss the others wait with theirs full.":"Snow Reaper (Final) 的月之疾风是带能量条的开关技能，开启时减速、寒冷并冻结射程内敌人。过去每几秒反复开关；现在副本轮换：前一个能量耗尽后下一个开启；射程内无目标时关闭以保留能量；一名副本对首领生效时，其他副本满能量等待。","Snow Reaper (Final)'s Gale of the Moon now plays in the simulator: her aura on every enemy in range, the freezes and the slow, a third of the time per copy. Her attacks also read their real shapes (a circle, a cone, then the whole field) instead of one enemy, and so do Violentine's. On your Daily Challenge test it reads wave 24 and 925M where the real run went to wave 25 with 778M; before, it said wave 8 with 8M. The team search now weighs her like that.":"模拟器现支持 Snow Reaper (Final) 月之疾风，包含射程内全体光环、冻结和减速，每副本覆盖约三分之一时间。攻击按实际形状（圆形、锥形、全场）计算，而非单体，Violentine 同样修正。每日挑战测试现预测第 24 波、925M 伤害，实战为第 25 波、778M；过去仅预测第 8 波、8M。队伍搜索按这些结果评估。","Some evolutions need the unit's own takedowns (Shinobi (Hood) needs 7,500). The farm puts that unit on your team only for runs the simulator says you still win with 30% tougher enemies, counts its takedowns every match, and puts your team back after each run. Units → Goals.":"部分进化需本单位自身击杀数，如 Shinobi (Hood) 需要 7,500。只有模拟确认加入训练者后仍可击败强度提高 30% 的敌人，才将它编入队伍；每局统计击杀，结束后恢复原队伍。位于“单位 → 目标”。","Spending":"支出","Spending summary":"支出汇总","Spends read your gems and event coins the moment they change, not the profile copy that only updates after a teleport.":"资源变化时立即读取宝石和活动币，而非使用传送后才更新的配置缓存。","Stages":"关卡","Star Fruits For Gold":"用星果兑换金币","Start Study":"开始研究","Start new dungeon runs":"开始新的地牢探索","Start the next eligible stage after a run.":"每局结束后开始下一个符合条件的关卡。","Stat rolls are better at 100% Worthiness or more, so Auto Stats waits for it. Lobby tab, Wait For Worthiness.":"100% 或更高资质可获得更好的属性结果，因此自动属性重抽会等待。位于“大厅 → 等待资质”。","State":"状态","Stop Study":"停止研究","Stop and remove the window":"停止并移除窗口","Storm Hideout Raid: Act 1 · 0% win · ≈0 gems/min\nraid: 30 gems + items · sim: loses at wave 3 of 20, even against enemies at a quarter of their health":"风暴藏身处突袭：第 1 幕 · 胜率 0% · 约 0 宝石/分钟\n突袭：30 宝石＋物品 · 模拟：即使敌人生命值降至四分之一，仍在 20 波中的第 3 波失败","Story":"剧情","Story & Legend":"剧情与传说","Story Map saved value":"剧情地图已保存值","Story map":"剧情地图","Story saved value":"剧情已保存值","Strange Town Raid: Act 1 · 0% win · ≈0 gems/min\nraid: 30 gems + items · sim: loses at wave 3 of 20, even against enemies at a quarter of their health":"奇异小镇突袭：第 1 幕 · 胜率 0% · 约 0 宝石/分钟\n突袭：30 宝石＋物品 · 模拟：即使敌人生命值降至四分之一，仍在 20 波中的第 3 波失败","Study":"研究","Study a unit":"研究单位","Study runs":"研究对局","Subsystems":"子系统","Summer Charms give bonuses in the Summer Hunt and Sky Portals, one worn at a time. Before either, the farm puts on the one that helps most: more rewards where your team wins with room to spare, more damage where it might lose. Charms only change in the lobby, so a replay goes through it once when a better one is waiting. Farm → Events.":"夏日护符在夏日狩猎和天空传送门中提供加成，一次佩戴一个。开局前选择最有帮助的：胜算充足优先奖励，有失败风险优先伤害。护符只能在大厅更换，因此有更佳护符待装备时，重玩会先经过一次大厅。位于“刷取 → 活动”。","Summer Hunt":"夏日狩猎","Summer Hunt saved value":"夏日狩猎已保存值","Summer Pearl Value":"夏日珍珠估值","Summer Pearls To Keep":"保留夏日珍珠","Summon":"召唤","Summon:":"召唤：","Summons Per Visit":"每次到访的召唤次数","Surface":"表层","Systems":"系统","Tab":"标签页","Takedown training":"击杀训练","Takedown training checked its swap on a portal's plain level, not its tier's tougher enemies. Now it checks the tier it will play.":"击杀训练原先按传送门基础难度检查换队，现在会按实际挑战层级的更强敌人检查。","Target evolution":"进化目标","Target unit":"目标单位","Targeting:":"索敌：","Team planning":"队伍规划","Team upgrades":"队伍强化","Team:":"队伍：","Text":"文字","The \"no progress for 6 minutes\" safety no longer walks out of a boss fight on the last wave (a final boss was left at half HP and the room started over).":"“6 分钟无进度”保护不再在最后一波首领战中退出；此前曾留下半血首领并重开房间。","The April banner only spends AprilCoins while Chuuni (SS once evolved) or Vengeful Swordsman (S) is missing, not on Violentine (B) or Kansai (D).":"四月卡池只在缺少 Chuuni（进化后 SS）或 Vengeful Swordsman（S）时花费四月币，不为 Violentine（B）或 Kansai（D）抽取。","The Artifact Stage (a new one every 14 days) is played now, alone, ahead of other kinds while your team has a chance there, until its 10 clears are in: 30 gems a clear, and at 3, 5 and 10 clears 15 Limited Star Remnants and 250 gems in all, claimed for you. The simulator reads its enemies 2.1× tougher, as the stage says, until real runs measure them. Losses rest it like any mode. Farm → Stages: Off, On or Only this.":"新增神器关卡自动挑战：每 14 天更换一关，有胜算时优先单人挑战，直至完成 10 次。每次 30 宝石；第 3、5、10 次通关奖励合计 15 个限定星之残片和 250 宝石，自动领取。获得实测前按关卡说明的 2.1 倍敌人强度模拟，连败时和其他模式一样休息。“刷取 → 关卡”可选关闭、开启或仅此模式。","The Daily Challenge now goes through the game's matchmaking first, since its enemies get no tougher with more players. If nobody joins within the wait (2 minutes to start with), it plays alone. Both are under Play → Challenges.":"每日挑战现在优先使用游戏匹配，因为该模式敌人不会随人数增加而变强。等待超时无人加入（初始 2 分钟）则单人开始；设置均位于“游玩 → 挑战”。","The Daily's weaknesses and resistances now count at the numbers the game really gives its enemies, the same ones its Level Modifiers panel shows (for example ×1.66 physical, and magic cut to ×0.43), where the farm used to guess ×1.5 and ×0.5.":"每日挑战弱点与抗性现采用游戏等级修正面板的真实数值，例如物理 ×1.66、魔法降至 ×0.43，而非过去估计的 ×1.5 和 ×0.5。","The Units → Goals lists your 10 strongest evolutions, by the guides' rating and then the score at level 100. Pick one to focus on and its items and takedowns come first, or leave it on Smart Play and the farm chooses.":"“单位 → 目标”列出最强的 10 个进化选项，先按攻略评级，再按 100 级评分排序。手选目标后优先其材料与击杀数；也可保持智能游玩，由脚本选择。","The dungeon joins the ranking: 20 rooms in a row, one room a run. The farm goes for Rare Chests first, keeps them (and chests) for floor 20 so every luck item bought on the way counts, keeps its coins for the shops at floors 10–15, and buys chest luck in every shop (keeping coins back for it while another shop room is ahead). Rare Chests come with curses, so each curse is judged by what it does, and a curse is skipped only if the simulator says your team can't beat rooms with it. A room gives 5 tries, and clearing one refills them. Modes tab.":"地牢加入模式排名：连续 20 房，每房为一局。优先取得稀有宝箱，并将普通及稀有宝箱留到第 20 层再开，让沿途购买的幸运物品全部生效；保留金币用于第 10–15 层商店，并在每个商店购买宝箱幸运，前方还有商店时预留费用。稀有宝箱附带诅咒，逐项评估，仅在模拟认为附加后队伍打不过房间时跳过。每房有 5 次尝试，通关补满。位于“模式”页。","The farm can now play the Summer Hunt: 50 waves, a new map and weather every hour. It picks each card by what it pays and what it costs your team, and claims finished bingo lines. It never spends Summer Pearls or trades gems for them. Turn on Summer Hunt Only to play it.":"支持夏日狩猎：50 波，每小时更换地图和天气。按收益及对队伍的影响选择卡牌，并领取完成的宾果连线。此版不会花费夏日珍珠，也不会用宝石兑换；打开“仅夏日狩猎”即可挑战。","The farm looks for the best team before every run and plays whatever it ranks first. Relics now move once, after the team is settled, and a tiny relic gain no longer costs a trip to the lobby.":"每局前寻找最佳队伍并选择排名第一的模式。队伍确定后只分配一次遗物，不再为了微小遗物收益返回大厅。","The farm no longer rerolls stats or traits, on the Units → Upgrades or the Lobby tab. Your Stat Cubes, Star Remnants and tokens stay yours to use by hand.":"“单位 → 强化”和“大厅”不再自动重抽属性或特性；属性方块、星之残片和代币留给你手动使用。","The farm now equips the best team it finds before each run, unless you switched Auto-Equip Best Team off yourself (Battle → Planner). Your own team goes back after.":"每局前自动装备搜索出的最佳队伍，除非你在“战斗 → 规划器”手动关闭此功能；结束后恢复原队伍。","The farm now makes your 8 core units stronger with what you already have: XP food from the gold shop (gold kept for you), Stat Cubes to your grade, trait rerolls where a roll beats the trait on average, your unused relics, and a limit break once a unit is at its cap with a Divine Wish and spare units. One action at a time, each judged by how much of the team's damage it adds, with the game's own unit maths. Dry Run is on at first: it only says what it would do.":"现可用现有资源强化 8 个核心单位：从金币商店购买经验食物并保留金币，用属性方块达到目标等级，平均收益优于当前特性时重抽，分配闲置遗物，以及满级且有神圣愿望和多余单位时突破。每次只执行一个操作，用游戏原生单位公式评估全队伤害提升。默认开启预览，只说明计划操作。","The game has two, so the Lobby tab does too. Limit Break raises the level cap. Fuse For XP feeds spare units into the one you pick, up to its level cap: only level-1 units, never locked ones, and never Mythic or better, since a limit break needs those. It stays off until you switch it on, and it can't be undone.":"大厅提供游戏中的两种融合：突破提高等级上限；经验融合将多余单位喂给所选目标，直到其等级上限。此版仅用 1 级、未锁定且低于神话的单位，神话及以上留作突破素材。默认关闭，需手动启用，消耗后不可撤销。","The game hides many units' upgrades and attacks until they're played. The farm now fills those gaps with community data, so the team search can judge them, and the game's own numbers replace it the first time a unit plays.":"游戏在单位实际出战前隐藏很多升级与攻击数据。现先用社区数据补齐供队伍搜索判断，首次实际出战后用游戏原始数值替换。","The game hides the upgrades of about half its Mythic and Secret units (every April, Sakamoto and current banner unit) until they're in a match. The farm now records them when a match sends them, and until then calls those units \"strength unknown\" instead of weak: no goal value, no automatic evolve and no summons on a guess.":"约一半神话和秘密单位（四月、Sakamoto 及当前卡池单位）的升级数据需出战才公开。现在记录对局下发的数据；此前标为“强度未知”，而非判为弱单位，不赋予目标价值、不自动进化，也不凭猜测召唤。","The game only rolls a trait on a unit that isn't equipped, and said so in red. The unit now leaves your team for the roll and goes back in its slot.":"游戏只允许为未装备单位重抽特性，并会红字提示；现在会暂时卸下目标，重抽后放回原槽位。","The game opens one portal every 30 seconds, and a portal that gave no answer could still count. The farm tried again 12 s later, the game said no, and the try after that went in. Now it waits for a slow portal until the 30 s are nearly up and plays it if it opens, and a retry goes once they're over. In the match, a start vote the game errors on is sent again: twice the match after a retry stood for over a minute before its first wave.":"游戏每 30 秒只开一个传送门，即使无响应也可能计入。过去 12 秒后重试被拒，再下一次才成功；现在慢传送门会等待接近 30 秒，有开启则进入，超时后才重试。对局内若开局投票报错会重发，修复重试后首波曾等待超过一分钟的问题。","The game refuses a pull that comes a few seconds after the last one, and the farm used to stop there for 10 minutes. It now waits a moment and carries on.":"游戏会拒绝间隔过短的召唤；过去脚本会因此停 10 分钟，现在稍等片刻后继续。","The guides rank evolved, fully upgraded units and ignore traits (a strong trait can move a unit a whole tier). Their advice: save gems and commit to one banner.":"攻略评级基于已进化、满升级单位，不计特性；强力特性可能提升整档评级。建议保留宝石，集中投入一个卡池。","The guides say Windsong and Commander buffs chain up to +100%. The farm tests it once in a match (a second copy's buff while one is up) and chains them from then on only if it really adds up.":"攻略称 Windsong 与 Commander 增益可衔接至 +100%。现在会在实战测试一次增益尚在时第二个副本的效果，仅在确实可叠加时才持续衔接。","The mode ranker now counts the XP a run gives your units, and values a Divine Wish, Star Remnants and Stat Cubes by what they'd do for your core units. The Daily Challenge is played once a day whatever the Farm → Stages says, since it pays the wish, remnants and cubes.":"模式排名现计入单位获得的经验，并根据对核心队伍的帮助为神圣愿望、星之残片和属性方块估值。无论“刷取 → 关卡”如何设置，每日挑战每天都会进行一次，以获取这些奖励。","The most damage per yen":"每单位日元带来的最高伤害","The old tabs are one switch away: Settings, Show All Settings.":"在“设置 → 显示全部设置”开启后，可查看旧版标签页。","The panel now shows an event's switches only while the game runs it. Fool's Hunt and the April banner are out of the game, so their switches are hidden. If they come back, their switches do too. The same goes for the Summer Hunt when it ends.":"界面只在活动实际开放时显示对应开关。愚者狩猎与四月卡池目前不在游戏中，因此隐藏，回归后自动显示；夏日狩猎结束时也同样处理。","The simulator now knows Update 21's other enemy types: nothing slows or stuns a Fire enemy, only hill units can hit a Soaring one, and Armored and Ice enemies take less damage. How much less, the farm measures from the game's own damage numbers, and counts it only once the readings agree (Ice enemies: a third, from everything but fire). The Flying Enemies and Armored Enemies challenges count too.":"模拟器支持更新 21 的其他敌人类型：火焰敌人免疫减速和眩晕；翱翔敌人只接受高台单位攻击；装甲和寒冰敌人减伤。减伤比例由游戏伤害实测，多次结果一致后才计入（寒冰对除火外伤害只承受三分之一）。飞行敌人与装甲敌人挑战也会计入。","The simulator plays waves the way the game does: each wave's yen ×2.6 (the world's money boost), the early skip vote (about 2 s + 2 s per enemy, at most 30 s) and an enemy at your base taking it down in seconds.":"模拟波次按真实游戏规则：每波日元 ×2.6（世界金钱加成），提前跳波投票耗时约 2 秒加每个敌人 2 秒，最多 30 秒；敌人抵达基地后数秒内即可摧毁基地。","The team planner now also tries your damage-over-time units and every farm, and judges teams near their breaking point, where a difference shows. In a dungeon the simulator now plays each room's last-wave boss with its real HP, and damage over time stays on a lone boss instead of vanishing. With Auto-Equip Best Team on (Battle → Planner), the better team goes in before a dungeon run's first room and after a lost try.":"队伍规划器现也测试持续伤害单位和全部经济单位，在接近队伍极限处评估以拉开差距。地牢最后一波首领按真实生命模拟，单个首领也会持续受到持续伤害。开启“战斗 → 规划器 → 自动装备最佳队伍”后，首房前及失败重试后会换入更佳队伍。","The team search leaves out units under level 50, so a weak unit doesn't take a slot. On a new account every unit is under 50, so the search had nothing to pick from and kept whatever team you set. That rule now waits until you own 6 kinds of attacker at level 50 or more. Before that, the search picks your best units at any level, and the farm equips what it finds.":"为避免弱单位占位，队伍搜索原先排除低于 50 级单位，导致新账号全部低于 50 级时没有候选，只保留手选队伍。现在拥有至少 6 种 50 级及以上攻击单位后才启用此限制；此前可选任意等级的最佳单位，并自动装备搜索结果。","The team search used to stop testing at enemies ×4, so on easy maps every team looked the same and a swap could come down to seconds. It now keeps making enemies tougher until your team breaks, and a swap has to really go further over that whole test. Otherwise your team stays.":"过去队伍测试在敌人 4 倍强度时结束，简单地图各队相似，换队可能只取决于几秒差异。现在持续提高敌人强度直至队伍达到极限；新队必须在整套测试中明显更进一步才替换，否则保留原队伍。","The window and its round button now stay above the game's own screens.":"窗口及圆形按钮现在始终显示在游戏界面上方。","Theme":"主题","This hour: Virtual Dungeon, Sandstorm.\nNext hour: map hidden, Rainy.\nNot played yet. A full run should pay about 1348 Summer Pearls.\nBingo: 0 of 36 squares, 0 of 14 lines. Weathers won: 0 of 9.\nCards: the most secret luck, then the most pay. Secret luck only comes on the harder cards, so one is skipped when it would leave your team too weak to win.\nYou hold 0 Summer Pearls. The farm never trades gems for them, and spends them only on Sunny Stars, only with Open Sunny Stars on.":"本小时：虚拟地牢，沙尘暴。\n下小时：地图未公开，下雨。\n尚未挑战；完整一局预计约 1348 夏日珍珠。\n宾果：36 格中完成 0 格，14 条线中完成 0 条；9 种天气中战胜 0 种。\n卡牌：先选择秘密单位幸运最高，其次收益最高。秘密幸运仅出现在较难卡牌；会使队伍失去胜算的卡将跳过。\n持有夏日珍珠 0。脚本不会用宝石兑换，仅在开启“开启夏日星”时花珍珠开星。","Tier ratings for units the game hides, banner picks, buff chaining":"隐藏单位评级、卡池推荐、增益轮换","Tracks how far down the road your units reach. When enemies get to the end of that stretch, the next unit goes further down the road. If one slips past them all, a unit goes right in its way: one enemy at your base ends the run.":"跟踪单位沿路线的覆盖范围。敌人到达当前覆盖末端时，下个单位向前方更深处部署；若有敌人突破全部防线，就直接在其前方放单位，因为一个敌人到基地就可能结束对局。","Train takedowns":"训练击杀数","Training:":"训练：","Transparent":"透明","Tries spots for each attacker at the start of a match":"每局开场为各攻击单位测试放置点","Tries your other units against each mode's weak and strong elements and shows the team that does best (Battle → Planner). It only equips it if you switch that on.":"按各模式弱点与抗性测试你持有的其他单位，并展示最佳队伍（战斗 → 规划器）。只有开启自动装备后才实际替换。","Two new buttons on the Settings → General. Go To Lobby leaves the match at once, and the farm starts no other match until you press Start Farming Again. Summons, fuses and stars you switched on keep running in the lobby. A match that was already starting when you pressed it comes straight back.":"“设置 → 通用”新增两个按钮。“返回大厅”立即离场，直到点击“重新开始刷取”前不再开局；已启用的召唤、融合和开星在大厅继续。若点击时已有对局正在启动，也会立刻返回。","Type config name here...":"在此输入配置名称……","UI Scale":"界面缩放","UNIT":"单位","Unavailable modes":"不可用模式","Unit To Feed saved value":"经验融合目标已保存值","Unit To Limit Break saved value":"突破目标已保存值","Unit To Snipe saved value":"定向召唤单位已保存值","Unit To Study":"研究目标单位","Unit To Study saved value":"研究单位已保存值","Unit strength comes from the game's formula at full upgrade: level, trait (Unique, Golden...), stat rolls, curses, relic buffs and the mode's weak/strong elements.":"单位强度使用游戏公式，以满升级为基础，计入等级、特性（Unique、Golden 等）、属性结果、诅咒、遗物增益及模式的弱点和抗性。","Unit to level":"升级目标单位","Units":"单位","Units whose worth goes to the rest of the team, like buffers, Zombie (Risen)'s blessing on summons and a Gale over the road, are now tried in every slot of the team search. They used to rank by their own damage and were mostly never tried.":"增益辅助、Zombie (Risen) 召唤祝福、覆盖道路的疾风等价值主要体现于队友的单位，现会在队伍搜索每个槽位尝试。过去只按自身伤害排名，因此几乎从未入选。","Unload":"卸载","Unlock Value":"解锁价值","Update 21 changed how the game checks unlocked levels, which units hit flyers, and where it keeps trait odds and difficulty numbers. The farm reads all of them the new way, so it plays again and the team search and Units → Upgrades work.":"更新 21 改变了已解锁关卡的检查方式、单位对空规则，以及特性概率和难度数据位置。现按新方式读取，恢复自动游玩、队伍搜索和“单位 → 强化”。","Update 21 moved where the game marks an enemy as flying, and since then the simulator played every flyer as a ground enemy. It reads the new place now, so team picks and predictions know again that units without anti-air do half damage to flyers and can't slow or stun them.":"更新 21 移动了飞行敌人标记位置，过去模拟器将所有飞行敌人误当陆地敌人。现已按新位置读取，让队伍选择与预测正确计入普通单位对空伤害减半且不附带减速或眩晕。","Updates":"更新","Upgrade core units. Preview mode shows spending before you enable it.":"强化核心单位；预览模式会在启用前展示支出。","Upgrade rules":"强化规则","Upgrade:":"强化：","Upgrades":"强化","Use The Simulator":"使用模拟器","Use Units Up To saved value":"可用单位上限已保存值","Use farm picks":"采用自动推荐","Use pearls above the reserve for the planned target.":"为规划目标花费超出保留量的珍珠。","Use spare units after showing the planned fodder.":"展示素材方案后，再使用多余单位。","Use the stronger team before a run, then restore yours.":"开局前使用更强队伍，之后恢复你的队伍。","Uses the selected fodder after the preview countdown.":"预览倒计时结束后，消耗所选素材。","Violentine (Brutal Angel) raises the last enemy she hit when it dies, so she now stands at the road's entrance, where enemies come before your other units reach them, the spot a unit in takedown training gets. Her raised enemies take Zombie (Risen)'s blessing too.":"Violentine (Brutal Angel) 会复活其最后命中过的死亡敌人，因此现在像击杀训练单位一样站在道路入口，在其他队员攻击前先命中。其复活敌人也能获得 Zombie (Risen) 祝福。","Votes to start once the first unit is down":"放下第一个单位后投票开始","Waiting for game data.":"等待游戏数据。","Wave progress":"波次进度","Weather":"天气","Weather Mode":"天气模式","When the portal kind you picked runs out (or Only Portals finds nothing on Smart), the farm plays your other portals, best first, instead of waiting.":"所选类型的传送门用完（或“仅传送门”的智能模式未找到目标）后，会按强度优先使用其他持有传送门，而非等待。","When the simulator says your team can't win the Daily alone, the farm plays it only with other players: if nobody joins, it tries matchmaking again in 10 minutes instead of losing it alone. On the morning this came in, 11 of 11 Dailies played alone were lost and 5 of 5 played with others were won. With Matchmake The Daily off, it waits for a team that can win it.":"模拟认为队伍单人打不过每日挑战时，只与其他玩家组队；无人加入则 10 分钟后重新匹配，不再单人送败。该改动当天上午，单人 11 局全败，组队 5 局全胜。关闭每日匹配时，则等待能获胜的队伍。","When the team search's pick and your own team came out even, your own team stayed, even with empty slots: a farm with 3 of 6 slots filled got a full team for a few runs, then went back to its 3. A tie now goes to the team that fills more slots.":"搜索队伍与原队伍平局时，过去即使原队有空位也保留，曾出现只装备 3/6 单位，短暂用满队后又恢复 3 人的情况。现在平局优先槽位更满的队伍。","Where enemies spend the most time in range":"敌人在射程内停留时间最长的位置","Windsong's buff adds up: +30% with one, +69% with two, +100% with three. The farm used to fire its buffers whenever units needed one, so they went off together and ran out together, and your units sat at +30% most of the time. Now the copies take turns, one every few seconds, so as many buffs stay up as your copies can hold (6 Windsongs: +100%). It learns which buffers stack from its own readings. Windsong buffs magic units only.":"Windsong 增益可叠加：一层 +30%，两层 +69%，三层 +100%。过去所有辅助同时开技能、同时结束，多数时间只有 +30%。现在副本每隔几秒轮流施放，尽量维持可达最高层数（6 个 Windsong 可保持 +100%）。是否可叠加由实测学习，且 Windsong 只增强魔法单位。","Wins / losses":"胜场／败场","With a mode's matchmaking switch on, the farm goes back to the lobby and matchmakes again after every run. A replay used to start the next run alone, without the players who'd joined.":"开启某模式组队匹配后，每局结束都会返回大厅重新匹配；过去直接重玩会丢失原本匹配加入的玩家，变成单人。","Works out the best team from all your units for the top modes":"从全部单位中为优先模式规划最佳队伍","Write AA_SmartFarm/settings.json":"写入 AA_SmartFarm/settings.json","XP food":"经验食物","Your team, your picks, then the attackers the planner used most this week":"优先你的队伍、手选单位，再考虑本周规划器最常用的攻击单位","Your team:":"你的队伍：","[☀️更新21🏖️] 动漫冒险":"[☀️更新21🏖️] 动漫冒险","goals are worked out in the lobby":"在大厅规划目标","image id or url":"图片 ID 或地址","loses at wave 3 of 20, even against enemies at a quarter of their health":"即使敌人生命值降至四分之一，仍在 20 波中的第 3 波失败","matches 0 · wins 0 · losses 0 · gems 0 · event coins 0":"对局 0 · 胜 0 · 负 0 · 宝石 0 · 活动币 0","more":"更多","no configs yet":"暂无配置","no core units yet":"暂无核心单位","no evolution is waiting on takedowns":"暂无进化需要等待击杀数","no match yet":"暂无对局","no predicted run yet":"暂无预测","no